WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.880
- Before we go everybody,

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.420
I have one last story to
put a smile on your face.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:05.838
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:08.730
(bouncy music)

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.040
(audience clapping)

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:14.000
The mullet, America's
most important hairstyle.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.930
Throughout history, it's been worn

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.258
by such luminaries as
Jean-Claude Van Damme.

00:00:19.258 --> 00:00:20.091
(audience laughing)

00:00:20.091 --> 00:00:21.180
He'll kick your butt.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.250
Joe Dirt.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.083
(audience laughing)

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:24.650
Go on a date with that dude.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:27.010
That one dude you went
to high school with.

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:29.738
That's our script supervisor
Derek back in the day.

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:31.270
(laughing)

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:34.133
And of course my good
friend, Mr. Blake Shelton

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.380
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.980
Freaking just awesome,

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.260
and it's curly as well.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.120
The curl is the best part, Blake.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.360
Ah, now it's time to add

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.920
one more name to that list.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:45.210
11 year old Allan,

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:47.170
who's the 2021 Kids Winner

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.190
at the USA Mullet Championship.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.134
He so good.

00:00:50.134 --> 00:00:50.967
(audience clapping)

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:54.160
Allan first grew his
luscious locks in quarantine.

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.423
His win comes with a cash prize.

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.560
(mimicking trumpet)

00:00:57.560 --> 00:00:58.650
But what's really cool,

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:00.570
is he donated all of it

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:01.960
to an important cause.

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.500
Let's say hi to Allan
and his mama, Leslie.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.623
Hi, you all!

00:01:05.623 --> 00:01:06.456
(audience clapping)

00:01:06.456 --> 00:01:07.289
- Hi.

00:01:07.289 --> 00:01:08.430
- Hello.

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:10.220
- Oh, my God! I love your hair.

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.450
You win man.

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:13.130
It's so, you've literally did.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.430
Um, but Allan give the
people what they want.

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:16.440
Show us your amazing hair.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.273
Can you turn around?

00:01:17.273 --> 00:01:19.530
Can you see, can you let us
see the party in the back?

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:20.363
Yeah!

00:01:21.339 --> 00:01:23.370
(audience clapping)

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:25.630
I feel like Blake Shelton
would be proud of you,

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:26.720
that's all I'm saying.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:28.520
Um, well, Leslie, whose idea was it

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:30.087
to grow his hair out?

00:01:30.087 --> 00:01:32.930
- Well, back in shut down 2020

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:35.270
when the world closed
down because of COVID,

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:37.470
we were trying to think of creative ways

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:38.353
to keep the kids entertained
and having a good time,

00:01:38.353 --> 00:01:43.353
and so we just started doing
crazy things with our hair.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:45.400
So my daughter dyed her hair teal,

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.030
I dyed mine red,

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:49.820
my husband had an awful mustache,

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.990
and Allan he did a mullet.

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:53.024
- I love it.

00:01:53.024 --> 00:01:53.857
(audience clapping)

00:01:53.857 --> 00:01:55.590
Oh my God, the reveal with the hat

00:01:55.590 --> 00:01:57.590
and the Beyoncé wind machine,

00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.820
all of it was so great.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:03.300
Um, so Allan, there was
a cash prize of $2,500

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:06.120
and you donated all of it, right?

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:06.953
- Yes ma'am.

00:02:06.953 --> 00:02:07.910
- Okay, so why'd you donate it?

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:08.743
I mean, that's amazing.

00:02:08.743 --> 00:02:11.470
But why did you do it and
where did you donate it?

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:14.170
- Well, I donated it to

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:17.620
foster care Project Zero
and Together We Foster

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:22.010
because I am been in foster care.

00:02:22.010 --> 00:02:24.950
So, I just want to give back to the people

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.218
who gave me this wonderful mom.

00:02:27.218 --> 00:02:31.301
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:34.840
- I'm fine.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.210
Everything is fine.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.991
- [Leslie] Yeah, we didn't that one.

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:38.824
- Oh my.

00:02:38.824 --> 00:02:39.770
- He didn't said that in the rehearsal.

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:41.870
- Oh my gosh, Allan, you just broke me

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.500
in like the most amazing tiny
little pieces ever just now.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.240
Um, so do you have any
plans to cut your hair?

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:48.140
Because it's kind of cool.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:50.190
You've got like a cool
country mullet going on,

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:51.510
but it's kind of Euro as well.

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:54.520
It's kind of Euro rock and
roll punk, I'm just saying.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.820
- Well, nobody's gonna touch my hair.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.843
(laughing)

00:02:58.843 --> 00:02:59.716
- I love it!

00:02:59.716 --> 00:03:01.336
(laughs)

00:03:01.336 --> 00:03:02.540
Thank you, Allan.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:03.470
We love you,

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:04.790
and that was such a beautiful thing

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.840
you did to donate the money.

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:10.380
I'm liking your post right
now, and that's not all.

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.020
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.540
the go-to pen of The Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.410
also loves your luscious mane.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:16.243
All right?

00:03:16.243 --> 00:03:17.350
So in recognition,

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:19.130
they'll be using their
FriXion erasable pen

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.400
to write you a cheque for a 1,000 dollars.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.348
How's that sound?

00:03:22.348 --> 00:03:23.617
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:03:23.617 --> 00:03:24.990
- Oh my God!

00:03:24.990 --> 00:03:26.217
- Yes!

00:03:26.217 --> 00:03:27.050
(clapping)

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:29.020
You can use that for yourself,

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.319
or you can donate it.

00:03:30.319 --> 00:03:32.630
You can do whatever,
but since you donated,

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:34.380
why don't you spend a
little something on yourself

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.178
and have fun, all right?

00:03:36.178 --> 00:03:37.011
- Okay

00:03:37.011 --> 00:03:38.680
- You can take, you can
take mama on a date.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.070
That'd be, that'd be cool.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.116
All right, well thank you guys so much.

00:03:42.116 --> 00:03:43.321
(audience clapping)

